      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have a really bad headache and a bit of a fever today. i've had hepatitis c for a few years now (already treated but still a bit worried about my liver) and i just wanted to know how much tylenol i can take at once to make this go away? i usually take a lot of it when i'm sick so just wanna be sure.",
