      "content": "thanks, but i feel like 1000mg is a small amount and it's not really hitting the pain. my doctor isn't really responding to my messages right now and i dont want to wait days for a call back just to deal with this fever. is it really that dangerous to just take 1500mg or 2000mg right now to get it under control? i feel like my liver is mostly fine since i finished the treatment.",
