      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what youre saying but im just so uncomfortable right now. i checked my online portal and it says the max dose is 4000mg a day so i dont really see how 2000mg once is gonna kill me. i just want to sleep this off. if i take 2000mg now and then wait like 8 hours to take more, is that actually going to cause liver damage? i feel like i know my body and it's handled worse than this.",
